# Raw supplier exports — source of truth for regenerating the catalog, never committed.
# They are only needed locally, to run scripts/prepare-mascot-csv.mjs (Mascot) and
# scripts/generate-catalog-data.mjs. What the site builds from is the generated
# src/data/catalog/products.<supplier>.json, which IS committed.
src/data/suppliers/**/*.csv
